{"checkedAt":"2026-09-27T03:05:10.944Z","sourceUrl":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/704","imdbCode":"tt0983983","seriesTitle":"Shaun the Sheep","imdbRating":8.1,"imdbVotes":20459,"episodes":[{"season":1,"episode":1,"title":"Off the Baa!","summary":"Children's animation set on a remote rural farm. Shaun's flock lives a peaceful life under the watchful eye of their sheepdog Bitzer, but Shaun's insatiable curiosity often leads him into the unlikeliest adventures. A cabbage from a passing truck bounces into the field and Shaun decides to use it as a football, but the pigs are out to spoil the sheep's game.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665647c2406e8.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":2,"title":"Bathtime","summary":"Children's animation featuring the curious young sheep. The flock does not want to wash in freezing sheep dip, so Shaun hijacks the hot water from the farmer's bathtub.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665647e768632.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":3,"title":"Shape Up with Shaun","summary":"Children's animation set on a remote rural farm. Shirley the sheep has put on weight, so Shaun helps her get in shape with a rigorous exercise regime.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/6656482c92ddd.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":1,"episode":4,"title":"Timmy in a Tizzy","summary":"Children's animation. On a remote rural farm, Shaun's flock lives a peaceful life under the watchful eye of their sheepdog Bitzer. But Shaun's insatiable curiosity often leads him into the unlikeliest adventures. When the Farmer takes Timmy's favourite sheep dolly, the little lamb won't stop crying. So Shaun rallies the flock to get it back from Pidsley, the farm cat!","imageUrl":"https://artw