/banners/episodes/79890/665e08d6a3c8e.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":5,"title":"The Farmer's Nephew","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e08ec9421f.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":6,"title":"Babysitter Bitzer","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0904e85ee.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":7,"title":"Dodgy Lodger","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e091defe47.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":8,"title":"Dangerous Deliveries","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0935e5bd9.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":9,"title":"Timmy and the Dragon","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e095046e26.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":10,"title":"Bitzer's New Whistle","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e096b5b863.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":11,"title":"Turf Wars","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0982ada8d.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":12,"title":"A Prickly Problem","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e09c9cdb83.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":13,"title":"Wanted","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0a06b3dd2.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":14,"title":"Rude Dude","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0a3453f0b.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":15,"title":"Keeping the Peace","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0a66b8ad0.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":16,"title":"Happy Farmers' Day","summary":"","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0a87009b1.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":17,"title":"Checklist","summary":"Animated Series. Bitzer's over-officious management style becomes too much for the sheep, who decide it's time for him to chill out. Bitzer's tasks for the day take on a new purpose, for everyone to have some fun.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0a9fb2bd1.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":18,"title":"Return to Sender","summary":"Animated Series. The Farmer receives a mystery gift from his antipodean cousin. Unimpressed with the present, he attempts to throw it away, only for it to keep reappearing. He becomes convinced it has magical powers.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0ab9d84cf.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":19,"title":"Cone of Shame","summary":"Animated Series. Bitzer is an all-too willing volunteer when he has to wear the cone of shame and is happy to let the flock wait on him. That is, until Shaun rumbles his malingering and plots the pooch's comeuppance.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0ae6e6ea9.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":5,"episode":20,"title":"Sheep Farmer","summary":"Animated Series. When Timmy sees a particularly grumpy farmer giving one of the flock a hard time, he decides to give him an idea of what it's like to be a sheep. But when the time comes to have the old farmer back, things aren't quite so simple.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/79890/665e0b20e52fe.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":1,"title":"Bake it Easy","summary":"Despite warnings, the sheep have gobbled up the birthday cake Bitzer has baked for the Farmer. Realising the kitchen cupboards are bare, Shaun and the flock must try and source ingredients for a new one from around the farm before Bitzer realises. The result is certainly a surprise!","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161017/screencap/683eaf47968bf.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":2,"title":"Shelf Life","summary":"When the Farmer accidentally drills a hole in a waterpipe while putting up a new shelf, Bitzer frantically tries to stop the leak from soaking the living room and prevent the Farmer's precious teapots from sliding off the shelf!","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161018/screencap/683eaf68907da.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":3,"title":"Bed Lamb","summary":"Shaun tricks Bitzer into thinking he is unwell so that he can stay in the barn playing video games all day. However, before long, the other sheep are also pulling sickies, and Bitzer is starting to get suspicious. The threat of nasty medicine has everyone out of bed in a flash!","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161019/screencap/683eaf7d84286.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":4,"title":"Shooting Stars","summary":"When a meteor shower is forecast to pass over Mossy Bottom, Bitzer really wants to see the shooting stars. However, he keeps getting distracted by the flock's curiosity and the Farmer's late-night picnic.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161020/screencap/683eaf90ef535.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":5,"title":"Doorbell","summary":"While proudly testing his new doorbell camera, the Farmer realises he has locked himself out. Bitzer must help his boss get back into the farmhouse while simultaneously making sure he doesn't spot Timmy and Shaun with a runaway kite.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161021/screencap/683eafb50f611.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":6,"title":"Bee Free","summary":"The Farmer has taken up beekeeping and is loving all the honey produced by the hive. However, when he discards his protective suit, the swarm move in, bringing it to life! Soon, the ‘Bee-Man' is bossing Bitzer around.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161022/screencap/685bead92ff3f.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":7,"title":"Hoof Fashion","summary":"Shaun steps in a can of red paint, and his resulting red hoof makes him a style icon on the farm. Before long, the rest of the flock try their own new looks and soon steal the limelight. As the outfits become more and more outrageous, Shaun wonders if less might sometimes be more.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161023/screencap/685beaea30339.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":8,"title":"Bitzer's Bale Out","summary":"The Farmer tasks Bitzer with baling up a fresh haystack, but the hungry sheep have hidden inside and are turned into moving bales. A wild game of chase the bale results as Bitzer tries to restore order to the hay field.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161024/screencap/685beafc32192.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":9,"title":"Whistle-Stop","summary":"Realising that Bitzer has a series of whistles which can control the flock's movements, Shaun steals them and soon has the flock dancing to his tune. When the Farmer finds the whistles stuck together like a harmonica, his dreadful playing gives Shaun a taste of his own medicine.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161025/screencap/685beb0d00fd2.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":10,"title":"Ruffing It","summary":"Renovations force Bitzer to camp out for the night. When the flock are shut out of the barn, they must also pitch up in the field. The sheep are loving their trendy glampsite at first, but as the weather worsens and batteries run low, the appeal of Bitzer's practical tent grows.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161026/screencap/685beb1f615fe.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":11,"title":"Power Cut","summary":"With the Farmer and Bitzer out at the Golden Tractor Awards, the flock take the chance to enjoy all the mod cons of the house – until they overload the power and the house is plunged into total darkness. When the Farmer returns, the flock must escape the house without getting caught.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161027/screencap/685beb322340d.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":12,"title":"Stuck in the Muck","summary":"After the Farmer manages to drive his tractor into a mud patch, Shaun, Bitzer and the flock try to rescue it from the quagmire. Before long, however, the stranded vehicle sinks far beyond their reach.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161028/screencap/685beb4569e1e.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":13,"title":"Spare Parts","summary":"When two different pieces of flat-pack furniture are delivered to the Farmer and Bitzer, confusion ensues as they start to mix up the pieces. Shaun and the Flock are forced to give them a lesson in following instructions.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161029/screencap/685bec27b2174.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":14,"title":"Sleep on It","summary":"An all-night gaming session turns the Farmer and Bitzer into sleep-deprived zombies the next day. Shaun takes the chance to change Bitzer's checklist to suit himself, but he manages to miss the final item: shearing time!","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161030/screencap/685bec3da425e.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":15,"title":"Treasure Hunt","summary":"Bitzer is horrified when the farmer scribbles all over his map showing the location of his buried bone and fears he will never rediscover his treasure. The flock are on hand to help him search, even if their methods are unorthodox.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161031/screencap/685bec506f473.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":16,"title":"Gone to the Dogs","summary":"Bitzer is embarrassed when his dad makes a surprise visit and finds the farmyard in a mess. Feeling sorry for Bitzer, Shaun and the flock make a real show of tidying up. Bitzer and his dad get some bonding time, but as soon as dad leaves, the place descends into anarchy once more.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161032/screencap/685bec6295968.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":17,"title":"Shirleyverse, Part 1","summary":"Shaun escapes through a ‘portal' inside Shirley's wool to flee an annoying Bitzer, only to emerge into a chaotic version of the farm without him. Desperate to escape, he repeatedly jumps back inside Shirley, emerging somewhere worse each time!","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161033/screencap/685bec7b8b5e3.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":18,"title":"Shirleyverse, Part 2","summary":"Shaun escapes through a ‘portal' inside Shirley's wool to flee an annoying Bitzer, only to emerge into a chaotic version of the farm without him. Desperate to escape, he repeatedly jumps back inside Shirley, emerging somewhere worse each time!","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11161034/screencap/685bec8cda731.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":19,"title":"Poultrygeist","summary":"When a chicken ends up inside Shaun's pillowcase, Shaun tries to get it back, only for the chicken to end up in the farmhouse and the Farmer to think he is being haunted.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11394667/screencap/69661033c3630.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"},{"season":7,"episode":20,"title":"Fleece Navidad","summary":"When Farmer Ben delivers his perfect Christmas card, Shaun and the gang secretly knit jumpers to try and make sure the Mossy Bottom Farm card is even more spectacular. But getting everyone to pose for the photo proves to be harder than it looks.","imageUrl":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11394668/screencap/6966111b5b535.jpg","imageSource":"thetvdb","imageAlt":null,"imagePosition":null,"imageFit":"cover"}],"episodeArtworkCheckedAt":"2026-09-27T03:05:10.944Z","episodeArtworkProvider":"thetvdb-public-screenshots"}